Z||000001||Rodney||07-27-2001||10:33 AM||||This is where I have been sending people. They work with them all the time and seem to be very good. Turnaround is very quick also. Bolt it to a piece of plywwod before you box it so the bellhousing does not get broken. You'll need to drill a hole as the input shaft is slightly sticking out past the bellhousing face.||||reg||1
